Description: Support the Qt 6.4 WebEngine permission API
 QWebEnginePermission and QWebEnginePage::permissionRequested() were added in
 Qt 6.8. Ubuntu 24.04 ships Qt 6.4.2, where applications must use
 featurePermissionRequested() and setFeaturePermission().
 .
 Keep the upstream Qt 6.8+ implementation unchanged and select the legacy API
 at compile time. Map legacy QWebEnginePage::Feature values to the numeric
 QWebEnginePermission::PermissionType keys used by current Whatsie so the
 application's saved permission settings retain the same meaning across both
 implementations.
Author: Reaper <JohnGrimmReaper@disroot.org>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-08-13

